{"synopsis":"The 31st Piece Turns the Tables\nDari studio yang mengerjakan Hyper Luck dan Demon Prince Goes to the Academy THE 31ST PIECE TURNS THE TABLES\nSejak dia masih kecil Kang Seol memiliki mimpi yang aneh setiap malam Dalam mimpinya dia adalah seorang orang dewasa yang memakai topeng dan berpakaian aneh di dunia yang tidak biasa\nBaiklah saatnya untuk melemparkan dadu\nPermainan dalam mimpinya The World of Eternity di mana dia menciptakan dan mengendalikan bidakbidak karakter yang ada di meja merupakan penghiburan dan kegemarannya bahkan mungkin seluruh dunianya\nDia senang melemparkan dadu dengan orangorang asing di dalam mimpinya Dia merasa bahagia\nBeraninya serangga tidak tahu diri ini menyelinap ke dalam surga\nsampai dia sendiri menjadi sebuah bidak di atas meja itu","alternative_title":"The 31st Piece Overturns the Board","author":"Nungwi, Wang Mojji","artist":"Kalma","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"177582bb-e6a0-41c4-ad8d-d619b3ca29fe","number":"111","chapter":"111","title":"","date":"2026-06-09","released":"2026-06-09"},{"chapter_id":"a3a2e4d0-2b12-4f73-8281-23def4483dd0","number":"110","chapter":"110","title":"","date":"2026-06-03","released":"2026-06-03"},{"chapter_id":"4225a965-74da-44ac-92f9-037bb5e247bf","number":"109","chapter":"109","title":"","date":"2026-05-29","released":"2026-05-29"},{"chapter_id":"b20f5c51-7774-436b-9c30-5be335259f11","number":"108","chapter":"108","title":"","date":"2026-05-29","released":"2026-05-29"},{"chapter_id":"709b7ad6-8c9e-4c8f-a775-0d0db8586435","number":"107","chapter":"107","title":"","date":"2026-05-20","released":"2026-05-20"},{"chapter_id":"53338883-74b5-482e-bb04-8fd67e2c3840","number":"106","chapter":"106","title":"","date":"2026-05-04","released":"2026-05-04"},{"chapter_id":"e16ad433-9481-4eb2-98a7-9012ac2abf85","number":"105","chapter":"105","title":"","date":"2026-04-28","released":"2026-04-28"},{"chapter_id":"e2bb3208-34fb-4962-baa7-033aff4ea1c9","number":"104","chapter":"104","title":"","date":"2026-04-2